WEBVTT

00:20:57.989 --> 00:21:00.077
I was giving a talk,
and he was in the back.

00:21:00.101 --> 00:21:01.287
He was in a wheelchair,

00:21:01.311 --> 00:21:04.301
and he was staring at me
the whole time I was giving this talk,

00:21:04.325 --> 00:21:06.860
and he had this stern,
almost angry look on his face.

00:21:06.884 --> 00:21:08.971
And when I finished my talk,
people came up.

00:21:08.995 --> 00:21:10.743
They were very nice and appropriate,

00:21:10.767 --> 00:21:13.616
but that older Black man
in a wheelchair just kept staring.

00:21:13.640 --> 00:21:15.900
And then he finally
wheels himself to the front,

00:21:15.924 --> 00:21:19.289
and when he came up to me, he said,
"Do you know what you were doing?"

00:21:19.313 --> 00:21:20.497
And I just stood there.

00:21:20.521 --> 00:21:23.421
And then he asked me again,
"Do you know what you're doing?"

00:21:23.445 --> 00:21:26.221
And I mumbled something.
I don't even remember what I said.

00:21:26.245 --> 00:21:29.256
And he asked me one last time,
"Do you know what you're doing?

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:31.581
Because I'm going to tell you
what you're doing."